ument_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0018-403142cccbf1:d01\", \"start\": 61, \"end\": 195, \"text\": \"He spent three seasons at Florida from 2010 to 2013 , playing in 53 games with 79 total tackles , 18.5 tackles for loss and 11 sacks .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0018-403142cccbf1:d01\", \"start\": 196, \"end\": 273, \"text\": \"He declared for the draft in 2014 after the conclusion of his junior season .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0018-403142cccbf1:d01\", \"start\": 274, \"end\": 364, \"text\": \"`` We 're very saddened to learn about the passing of former Gators player Ronald Powell .\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0018-403142cccbf1:d01\", \"start\": 365, \"end\": 492, \"text\": \"Our thoughts and prayers are with his family and loved ones , '' the school said via the Florida Gators Football account on X .\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0018-403142cccbf1:d01\", \"start\": 493, \"end\": 513, \"text\": \"Terms of Use Privacy\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0018-403142cccbf1:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 157, \"text\": \"Crime Immigration Terror True Crime Bryan Kohberger Politics Trump's First 100 Days Senate House Judiciary Foreign Policy Fox News Polls Elections World U.N.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0018-403142cccbf1:d02\", \"start\": 158, \"end\": 671, \"text\": \"Conflicts Terrorism Disasters Global Economy Environment Religion Scandals Opinion Media FOX Nation Coverage Entertainment Exclusives Country Music Royal Families Gene Hackman Blake Lively Diddy Game Shows Hot Videos Sports NFL College Football MLB NASCAR INDYCAR NBA NHL Golf Tennis Soccer UFC WWE Lifestyle MAHA Health Travel Food & Drink Games & Quizzes Deals FOX Business Personal Finance Economy Markets Watchlist Lifestyle Real Estate Tech Science & Tech Air & Space Security Innovation Video Games Military\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0018-403142cccbf1:d02\", \"start\": 673, \"end\": 769, \"text\": \"Ronald Powell, a renowned chess player, has been making waves in the world of competitive chess.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0018-403142cccbf1:d02\", \"start\": 770, \"end\": 870, \"text\": \"His strategic mind and deep understanding of the game have earned him numerous titles and accolades.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0018-403142cccbf1:d02\", \"start\": 871, \"end\": 1022, \"text\": \"Despite his young age, Powell has already competed in several international tournaments, showcasing his exceptional talent and dedication to the sport.\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0018-403142cccbf1:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 20, \"text\": \"and made one start .\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0018-403142cccbf1:d03\", \"start\": 21, \"end\": 124, \"text\": \"In his sophomore year , he became a regular starter for the Gators , playing and starting in 12 games .\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0018-403142cccbf1:d03\", \"start\": 125, \"end\": 279, \"text\": \"In an injury-plagued junior year , he tore his left ACL two different times , first in the spring Orange and Blue game , and again during rehabilitation .\"}, \"D4S4\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0018-403142cccbf1:d03\", \"start\": 280, \"end\": 332, \"text\": \"For the 2012 season , he earned a medical redshirt .\"}, \"D4S5\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0018-403142cccbf1:d03\", \"start\": 333, \"end\": 391, \"text\": \"In 2013 , Powell played in 11 games and started in eight .\"}, \"D4S6\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0018-403142cccbf1:d03\", \"start\": 392, \"end\": 532, \"text\": \"Professional career [ edit ] Pre-draft measurables Height Weight Arm length Hand span 40-yard dash 10-yard spli